Third-party software in the Docker image (abhaypratap/spendlens)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The container image also contains the following programs, unmodified, under
their own licenses. spendlens runs them as separate programs; it does not link
to them. Their source code is available at the URLs below, at the version tags
named in the Dockerfile (STEAMPIPE_VERSION, POWERPIPE_VERSION, AWS_PLUGIN_VERSION).

  - Steampipe              GNU AGPL-3.0   https://github.com/turbot/steampipe
  - Powerpipe              GNU AGPL-3.0   https://github.com/turbot/powerpipe
  - Steampipe AWS plugin   Apache-2.0     https://github.com/turbot/steampipe-plugin-aws
  - Steampipe's embedded PostgreSQL       PostgreSQL License  https://www.postgresql.org

Python dependencies installed in the image keep their own licenses, which are
recorded in each package's metadata under site-packages.
